Version: <VERSION>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: <ARCH>
Maintainer: Scrutiny Debugger <scrutinydebugger@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://scrutinydebugger.com
Recommends: libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: An open source debugging, development and testing tool for C/C++ embedded applications.
 Scrutiny works through source-level instrumentation and provides real-time
 variable inspection, graph plotting, and test automation via a GUI and CLI.
 .
 The GUI requires XCB libraries (listed under Recommends). The CLI and server
 run without a display on headless systems.
